<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BJ's Wholesale Club.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BJ's Wholesale Club.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Annie Erner started coverage of BJ's Wholesale Club with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $33.</p>
<p>-- stock was up 1-3/16 to 29-3/16.</p>
</text>
